ForeignType ForeignObject -- cast a foreign object to the given foreign type
****************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note SPACE: (Macaulay2Doc)SPACE,
  * Usage: 
        T x
  * Inputs:
      * T, a *note foreign type: ForeignType,, 
      * x, a *note foreign object: ForeignObject,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note foreign object: ForeignObject,, 

Description
===========

Cast the given foreign object to the given foreign type.  Note that the
addresses will remain the same.

+------------------------------------------+
|i1 : chararray4 = 4 * char'               |
|                                          |
|o1 = int8[4]                              |
|                                          |
|o1 : ForeignArrayType                     |
+------------------------------------------+
|i2 : x = chararray4 append(ascii "foo", 0)|
|                                          |
|o2 = {102, 111, 111, 0}                   |
|                                          |
|o2 : ForeignObject of type int8[4]        |
+------------------------------------------+
|i3 : y = charstar x                       |
|                                          |
|o3 = foo                                  |
|                                          |
|o3 : ForeignObject of type char*          |
+------------------------------------------+
|i4 : address x === address y              |
|                                          |
|o4 = true                                 |
+------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * "ForeignStructType ForeignObject"
  * *note ForeignType ForeignObject: ForeignType ForeignObject, -- cast a
    foreign object to the given foreign type
