nullPointer -- the null pointer
*******************************

Description
===========

This *note Pointer: Pointer, object represents the null pointer (see
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/null_pointer ), indicating that the pointer does
not refer to a valid object.

+----------------+
|i1 : nullPointer|
|                |
|o1 = (nil)      |
|                |
|o1 : Pointer    |
+----------------+

For the programmer
==================

The object *note nullPointer: nullPointer, is a *note pointer: Pointer,.

